# Phase 09 — Release

## Goal

Production-ready Supabase setup, APK handover via EAS Build, docs, and an honest unverified-items list.

## Tasks

- Production Supabase config; run migrations; provision owner.
- Backup and restore documentation.
- EAS Build (APK for handover); confirm no secrets bundled.
- Final `SETUP.md` and handover guide.
- List anything unverified in `BUILD_STATUS.md`.

## Done when

- [ ] Production config and migrations applied; owner provisioned
- [ ] Backup/restore docs written
- [ ] EAS APK builds successfully; no secrets in the bundle
- [ ] `SETUP.md` and handover guide complete
- [ ] Unverified items listed in `BUILD_STATUS.md`
- [ ] Lint, typecheck, and tests pass (or failures documented as unverified)

Update BUILD_STATUS.md, then stop and wait for me.
